KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
SAT - Reading & Writing (Year 2022)

Q1. Because the archaeologist was known for meticulous documentation, her peers found her preliminary conclusions unusually _____.
  (A) credible
  (B) dubious
  (C) precarious
  (D) superfluous
  Answer: A - Meticulous documentation makes conclusions believable and trustworthy (credible).


